--- the same three clauses AT DEFAULTS, which give a DIFFERENT answer ---
clause 2 sink:      2.5663 -> 2.6959 GtC/yr   PASS
clause 3 deep D14C: z -1.08 -> -1.52            FAIL -- AWAY
The clause-3 disagreement is NOT a contradiction and must not be averaged:
at defaults kz is low and the model is ALREADY over-depleted, so more
depletion is a loss; at the mode kz is 96.6 % up its bracket and the model
is under-depleted, so the same change is a gain. The mode is the operating
point the pump was proposed for, and the mode's verdict is the one that
answers handoff 15c sec.3.4.


